[{"answer":"Good morning. How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello. I'm interested in renting a house somewhere in the town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I have your name please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's Steven Godfrey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"And tell me how many bedrooms you're looking for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'd need 4, because I'm going to share the house with 3 friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, there are several of that size on our books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"They mostly belong to families who are working abroad at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the location?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be nice to be central.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"That might be difficult, as most houses of that size are in the suburbs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Still, there are a few.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your upper limit for the rent?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd like something around £500 a month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but we could go up to £600 if we have to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"But we can't go beyond that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know how long you want to rent the house for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The minimum let is 6 months, as you probably realise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We're at college here for two years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and we don't want to have to move during that time if we can avoid it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And how soon do you want to move in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"All our lets start on the first of the month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as soon as possible, really, so that means September 1st.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, let me have a look at what we've got....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We have photographs of all the houses on our books, so you can get an idea of what they're like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"There's this one in Oakington Avenue, at £550 a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Combined living room and dining room, with a separate kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't have a garage, though you can park in the road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, we'd prefer to have one, if possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Then have a look at this house, in Mead Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got a very large living room and kitchen, bathroom, cloakroom...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/34.mp3"},{"answer":"How much is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/35.mp3"},{"answer":"That one's 580.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very well furnished and equipped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It also has plenty of space for parking, and it's available for a minimum of a year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and there's a big garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think we could cope with that, to be honest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/40.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll be too busy to look after it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's this older house in Hamilton Road:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/43.mp3"},{"answer":"living room, kitchen-diner, and it has a study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/44.mp3"},{"answer":"550 a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That looks rather nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/46.mp3"},{"answer":"But whereabouts in Hamilton Road?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Towards the western end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that'll be very noisy. I know the area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's pretty lively.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people like it, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what about this house in Devon Close?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That looks lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/53.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a big demand for houses in that area, so prices tend to be quite high.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/54.mp3"},{"answer":"But this one hasn't been decorated for a few years, which has kept the rent down a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got a living room, dining room and small kitchen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's 595 a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it would suit you, from what you've said.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Why's that part of town so popular?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's a big scheme to improve the district, and it'll soon have the best facilities for miles around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/62.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a big sports centre under construction, which will be very impressive when it's finished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/63.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, the swimming pool's already opened, ahead of schedule,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's attracting a lot of people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/65.mp3"},{"answer":"What about cinemas: are there any in the area?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The only one closed down last year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's now in the process of being converted into a film museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The local people are trying to get a new cinema added to the scheme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I heard something about a plan to replace the existing concert hall with a larger one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, that's due to start next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it sounds an interesting area to live in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I go and see the house, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-1-2023-07-26-16-41-21/74.mp3"}]
